=== main ===
Hey! You're the new guy here, right?

I'm Tutorial Guy, glad to meet you!

Don't know what you're doing? Don't worry, me neither!

I can't really bother right now, so here's some quick tips...

~ HighlightSectionButtons()
You can visit each section using these buttons...

~ HighlightApproveButtons()
Use these butttons to approve or deny passengers...

~ HighlightRulesButton()
You can always read the rules for some clear and trusty guidance on how to procceed!

~ HighlightLineCounter()
This shows you how many passengers there are in a section. DON'T let it go over 6, they hate waiting...

~ DisableHighlights()
Anyways, there's a lot of them coming, good luck! 

-> end 

=== end ===
~ FinishDialogue()
-> END